#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Use the [`Neat` class](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) to analyze the noise impact on an Estimator workload.\n"
"- Review detailed [Sampler examples](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator examples](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) tutorial.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendações\">\n"
"- Use a [classe `Neat`](/guides/debug-qiskit-runtime-jobs) para analisar o impacto do ruído em uma carga de trabalho do Estimator.\n"
"- Revise exemplos detalhados do [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"
"- Revise exemplos detalhados do [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"
"- Leia [Migrar para primitivas V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Pratique com primitivas trabalhando na [lição de função de custo](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) no IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Aprenda como transpilar localmente na seção [Transpilar](/guides/transpile).\n"
"- Experimente o tutorial [Comparar configurações do transpilador](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
